    "replo_brand_rtb_section_NFWmHE": {
      "type": "replo-brand-rtb-section",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Brand RTB Section",
      "settings": {
        "replo_text_e2f669bc-9641-49af-91d9-38093586c460": "<p>We offer premium tea and botanicals imported directly from growers across the world and draw inspiration from ancient artisanal practices that use organic cultivation techniques<\/p>",
        "replo_text_82401179-66da-4e1a-bdbd-d29720bb9cd3": "<p>CERTIFIED ORGANIC<\/p>",
        "replo_text_1519d059-f905-4662-b137-46e8f3360904": "<p>Organic teas are healthier for the planet and people who grow, craft and enjoy steeping them. That's why over 95% of Rishi's ingredients are certified organic.<\/p>",
        "replo_text_900a78ae-2b4d-43d4-a1af-680bd6b45afd": "<p>DIRECT TRADE<\/p>",
        "replo_text_f85c9700-df24-4a5a-8ade-f0cf8c7b4c1d": "<p>Ethically sourced directly from artisan tea and botanical farmers around the world. Our deep relationships are the foundation of the authentic tea experiences you can expect from Rishi.<\/p>",
        "replo_text_0ddc6829-4c08-4de0-8e21-22dce2167edb": "<p>BEAUTIFUL INGREDIENTS<\/p>",
        "replo_text_439172d5-d485-4de1-a541-5ca5440a1b7c": "<p>Rishi teas are inspired by equal parts: ancient herbal medicinal traditions and modern culinary innovation. Discover new teas and botanicals in exciting, fresh and artfully crafted blends<\/p>"
      }
    },
